{"overview":"چا جی یون، کارمند سال هفتم یک شرکت است که از کار و قرار گذاشتن خسته شده است. او با کانگ سی وو، رئیس بدبین و بدگمان با شهرتی وحشتناک، آشنا می‌شود. به طور غیرمنتظره‌ای، او با شناختن مهربانی پشت کلمات تند او، دوباره جرقه‌ای در زندگی‌اش می‌زند. در میان رفت و آمدهای مکرر، حوادث کاری و روابط شکست خورده، این دو به تکیه‌گاه‌های بی‌بدیل یکدیگر تبدیل می‌شوند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Cha Ji-yoon is a 7th-year corporate worker who's tired of both work and dating. She crosses paths with Kang Si-woo, the cynical boss with a terrifying reputation. Unexpectedly, she regains spark in her life as she gets to know the kindness behind his stern words. Amid repeated commutes, accidents at work, and failed relationships, the two become each other's irreplaceable anchor.","tagline_en":"I found the perfect partner for both work and love!","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/8elsOXGUKIJ9CCnjHSh8j2fQxjP.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":["조은솔","McQueen Studio"],"crew_en":["Cho Eun-sol","McQueen Studio"],"countries":["KR"],"cast":[{"name":"서인국","role":"Kang Si-woo","photo":"/gs7RRZt2tWBJ7OR9BD3TFSYteJj.jpg","en":"Seo In-guk"},{"name":"박지현","role":"Cha Ji-yoon","photo":"/A3sGA6JjvkQbIvTjxhdukpIi8jC.jpg","en":"Park Ji-hyun"},{"name":"강미나","role":"Yoon No-ah","photo":"/sIGBlUCXt8pBqZhjesm4PKthEIn.jpg","en":"Kang Mi-na"},{"name":"원규빈","role":"Lee Jae-in","photo":"/ijhPuQAGgPia6I5k1b6wsAl8qmw.jpg","en":"Won Gyu-bin"},{"name":"Choi Kyung-hoon","role":"Cho Ga-eul","photo":"/xQT7YEgtJgN4Ta5nbWG4gDBJixs.jpg"},{"name":"한태하","role":"Koo Seung-jun","photo":"/yGqa1r8YGzZSNfeGoB2XnZZRp9k.jpg","en":"Han Tae-ha"},{"name":"김정영","role":"Han Woo-jin","photo":"/sJVUh3dzF1dgItQDPbWsZAsnfzL.jpg","en":"Kim Jung-young"},{"name":"강기둥","role":"Jeon Gi-tae","photo":"/488XqSA5N6bEb55yzKFmABERS92.jpg","en":"Kang Ki-doong"},{"name":"이재이","role":"Shin Na-ri","photo":"/oEsPK4N1jHD09lAeC7oDYTs5HXd.jpg","en":"Lee Jae-yi"},{"name":"한재훈","role":"Kim Yeong-jin"